OL,5,G0030 Through the Night
OL,6,     FThe Icelandic flautist plays
OL,7,     FProkofiev, Villa-Lobos and
OL,8,     FMendelssohn with cellist Sigurgeir
OL,9,     FAgnarsson and pianist Liam Kaplan.
OL,10,G0630 Breakfast
OL,11,     FMark Forrest presents Radio 3's
OL,12,     FBreakfast show. To get in touch,
OL,13,     Femail 3breakfast@bbc.co.uk.
OL,14,G0900 Sunday Morning
OL,15,     FSarah Walker with the perfect
OL,16,     Fclassical playlist to welcome in
OL,17,     Fthe month of November, including
OL,18,     Fmusic by Brahms, Bruckner and
OL,19,     FFaure.
